<Track #refactor-aiagent-runtime-context-control-plane version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" goal = "将参考项目中用于控制大模型执行上下文的 work_mode/task_phase、动态 prompt assemble、phase-aware compaction 与 continuation baseline 迁移为本项目的正式 runtime-first 控制面。" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-04-19T15:17:31Z" updated_at = "2026-04-25T14:45:32Z" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "docs" domain = "doc" path = "vfs://@/docs/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_refactor-aiagent-runtime-context-control-plane { name = "refactor-aiagent-runtime-context-control-plane" } (
    <Description ?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV06>
    重构 AIAgent Runtime Context Control Plane
    </?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV06>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P0 { name = "冻结迁移边界与建模基线" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV07>
        先把本 track 的设计对象冻结为 runtime context control plane，避免退化成局部 prompt helper 或单点压缩改造。
        </?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV07>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T0.1" name = "冻结迁移目标与非目标" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV08>
            明确本 track 的迁移对象包含正式 work context、prompt truth、phase-aware compaction、continuation baseline 与 runtime-first consumption，并排除照搬 reference prompt 文本和一次性做满全部技能生态。
            </?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV08>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T0.2" name = "对齐与前序 conversation persistence track 的接口边界" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV09>
            确认本 track 建立在既有 `.eidolon` conversation domain persistence 主链之上，新增本地副作用继续下沉 `cell/packages/ai-support`。
            </?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV09>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "定义 runtime context control contracts" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV0A>
        先把控制面中的正式 contract 和 graph/runtime family 边界定义清楚。
        </?01M05F1PD2S5KETY360C80ZV0A>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "定义 WorkContext contract" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRC>
            定义 `workMode`、`taskPhase`、source、timestamps 以及必要的 actor/session 关联字段，并明确它属于正式 runtime state。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRC>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "定义 PromptPlan / PromptGeneration / PromptTransform contract" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRD>
            在现有 conversation domain 上补齐 prompt truth 的结构化 contract，并明确 history truth 与 prompt truth 的边界。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRD>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.3" name = "定义 CompactionPolicyContext / Decision contract" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRE>
            为 phase-aware compaction 提供正式策略输入输出对象，至少覆盖 baseline epoch、token pressure、近期证据特征与 protected/rewritten categories。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRE>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.4" name = "定义 ContinuationBaseline contract" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P1" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRF>
            抽取 provider-agnostic baseline epoch / reset reason / continuation identity contract，并明确 compaction rewrite 后的 reset 语义。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRF>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "接通 turn start 与 tool round 的状态推进" status = "DONE" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRG>
        让 `work_mode` / `task_phase` 成为正式 runtime 状态，而不是渲染 prompt 前的局部推导。
        </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRG>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T2.1" name = "实现 turn start work context resolve" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRH>
            按显式上下文、当前状态继承、语义推导、默认值的优先级解析 `workMode`，并在 turn 开始时写回 actor/runtime state。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRH>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.2" name = "实现 task phase input inference" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRJ>
            根据用户输入和当前 `workMode` 推导 `context_build`、`implementation`、`verification`、`inspection_only` 等阶段。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRJ>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.3" name = "实现 tool round phase progression" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRK>
            根据工具种类和 round 结果推进 `taskPhase`，并把推进作为正式 runtime state change 记录。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRK>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.4" name = "补最小 tracing / debug projection" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P1" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRM>
            为 work context 变更补充 trace 或 debug projection，便于解释当前模式/阶段如何得出。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRM>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "迁移 plan-based prompt assembly" status = "DONE" order = 3 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRN>
        把 prompt 装配从局部字符串组装提升为正式 plan/generation/transform 主链。
        </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRN>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T3.1" name = "实现 PromptPlan 装配入口" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRP>
            把当前 prompt assembly 升级为结构化 `PromptPlan`，并在 metadata 中保留 `workMode`、`taskPhase` 与 routing decision。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRP>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "接最小 routing candidates 与 gating" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRQ>
            为 prompt modules / skills / subagents 预留正式 candidate manifest 与 routing decision，并让当前 work context 参与 gating。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRQ>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.3" name = "接 prompt request / overlay / summary transforms" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRR>
            让 prompt request、overlay、summary/context block 等变化记录为正式 prompt generation / transform，而不是直接改写最终消息数组。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRR>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.4" name = "补 prompt truth materialization tests" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRS>
            覆盖 history truth 与 prompt truth 分离、transform 解释和 runtime prompt view materialization 的回归。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRS>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P4 { name = "迁移 phase-aware compaction 与 baseline reset" status = "DONE" order = 4 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRT>
        让压缩真正受 work context 控制，并与 continuation baseline 建立正式联动。
        </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRT>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T4.1" name = "实现 compaction policy context / decision 主链" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRV>
            让 compaction 在执行前先产出正式策略 context 和 decision，并写入 runtime / persistence 可观察对象。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRV>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.2" name = "实现 phase-aware compaction 保护策略" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRW>
            根据 `taskPhase` 区分 discovery evidence、patch rationale、verification evidence 等保护类别，并调整 skip/summarize/rewrite 决策。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRW>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.3" name = "实现 baseline epoch reset orchestration" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRX>
            在 compaction rewrite 后提高 continuation baseline epoch，失效 continuation identity 与相关缓存，并把 reset reason 接入正式 runtime 状态。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRX>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.4" name = "在 ai-support 中补本地副作用实现" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRY>
            将新增的 `.eidolon` compaction policy / baseline / prompt truth 相关本地落盘副作用实现放在 `cell/packages/ai-support`。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRY>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.5" name = "补 compaction / continuation focused tests" status = "DONE" order = 4 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRZ>
            覆盖 phase-aware compaction、prompt summary transform、baseline epoch bump、cache reset 和 legacy fallback 回归。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SRZ>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P5 { name = "切换上层消费面到 runtime-first" status = "DONE" order = 5 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS0>
        让 TUI、headless 和 runtime bridge 读取正式的 context control plane，而不是继续散读局部状态。
        </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS0>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T5.1" name = "提供 runtime-first work context / prompt views 入口" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS1>
            增加统一 helper，使上层可读取 runtime 中的 work context、prompt truth、history truth 和 compaction state。
            </?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS1>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T5.2" name = "让 TUI/headless 消费正式 runtime context views" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS2>
            把主要上层消费面切到 runtime-first，仅在 runtime 不可用时回退 `.eidolon` persistence-first loader。
