          <Task { id = "T5.3" name = "补 session recovery / continue 回归" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PD3W4AQJKQWC1QQ9SS3>
            覆盖恢复历史 session、继续执行、压缩后续跑与 prompt truth 视图重建的主链回归。
